        "text_Yp4xt9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "A fold away exercise bike lets you ride when you want and reclaim your floor space when you are done. Ativafit folding exercise bikes are designed for apartments, bedrooms, home offices, and shared living areas where a full-size cardio machine may not fit.",
