    "image_tabs_NzVrRR": {
      "type": "image-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_7ixUVg": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Magnetic Resistance",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/5_c7df0068-b1f6-4031-8449-28d980c41870.webp",
            "text": "<p>Each Ativafit folding magnetic exercise bike uses magnetic resistance for smooth, low-noise training at home. Keep rides light for recovery or increase resistance for a more challenging daily cardio session.</p><ul><li>Smooth resistance changes</li><li>Low-noise indoor workouts</li><li>Light recovery rides or stronger cardio</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "tab_B7CWpm": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Choose the Ride That Feels Right.",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/bike_feature2.webp",
            "text": "<p>The F8 and F8 Pro support compact upright cycling, while the R8 adds a semi-recumbent position with back support. That makes it easier to choose a foldable home exercise bike based on comfort, space, and workout preference.</p><ul><li>Upright options for compact cardio</li><li>R8 back support for longer rides</li><li>Lower-impact movement at home</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "tab_hfnf7a": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Keep Every Ride Focused.",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/OPTIMIZE_BACKUP_PRODUCT_F8FoldableExerciseBikew.HealthMonitor-Ativafit_5.png",
            "text": "<p>Built-in digital monitors help you follow key workout metrics like time, speed, distance, and calories, so your foldable stationary bike routine has a clear goal.</p><ul><li>Track time and distance</li><li>Follow speed and calories</li><li>Use ride data to adjust effort</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "tab_7ixUVg",
        "tab_B7CWpm",
        "tab_hfnf7a"
      ],
